# Information Architecture / 情報設計

## Primary Organization / 主要な整理軸

Structure the product around **work units** (作業単位), not engineering feature modules.

### Top-Level Work Areas / トップレベル作業領域

| Work Unit (JA) | Work Unit (EN) | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| ホーム / 今日 | Home / Today | 今日やること、進行中案件の要約 |
| 案件 | Projects / Deals | 案件ライフサイクル全体 |
| 顧客 | Customers | 顧客・取引先情報と履歴 |
| タスク | Tasks | 実行可能な作業項目 |
| 調査 | Research | 情報収集とソース管理 |
| 成果物 | Artifacts | 提案書、議事録、レポート等 |
| 設定 | Settings | 組織・権限・連携（一般ユーザー向け名称） |

### Naming Rules / 命名規則

- Navigation labels use **domain language**, never `Provider`, `Repository`, `Worker`, `Pipeline`.
- Breadcrumbs reflect the user's mental model: `案件 > 〇〇商事 > 提案書下書き`.
- Settings group by **what the user configures**, not by backend service names.

## Page Structure / ページ構成

- **Compact page headers**: title + optional one-line context. No marketing hero blocks.
- **No double scroll**: one scroll container per view; nested scroll only inside intentional panes (e.g., document editor, data table with fixed header).
- Content-first layouts: tables, timelines, and inline editors over card grids.

## Anti-Patterns / アンチパターン

- Feature matrix home page with large rounded cards.
- "AI Hub" or "Chat" as the default landing.
- Exposing internal module names in empty states or onboarding.
- Giant KPI cards above every list view.
- Wrapping every list row in a bordered card.

## Cross-Cutting Concerns / 横断要件

- Mobile IA must be **purpose-built**, not a vertical stack of desktop columns (see `responsive-behavior.mdc`).
- Maintain type safety in route params and page data loaders; no `any` for navigation state.
- UI reads data via Application Services only; never direct Repository/Provider calls from components.

Completion gates: `typecheck`, `lint`, `test`, `build` must pass before shipping IA changes.
